# Route: guide 39 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 56 to
# 58, 83 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stormwind City, Feralas, Thousand Needles, Stranglethorn Vale,
# Ironforge, Darnassus): near Stormwind City -> Stormwind City -> near
# Stormwind City -> near Stormwind -> Stormwind -> near Stormwind -> near
# Stormwind City -> Stormwind -> near Stormwind City -> Stormwind City -> near
# Stormwind -> near Stormwind City -> Stormwind City -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Encrusted Tail Fins (1107;
# Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale Tide Lord 37,
# Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); A Host of Evil (6626;
# Razorfen Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist
# 33-34); Rise, Obsidion! (3566; Lathoric the Black 52, Obsidion 52).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Quell The Uprising (387), Quell the Uprising (387), The
# Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood (388), The Stockade Riots (391),
# The Stockade Riots (391), Underground Assault (2040), Underground Assault
# (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green Sample (92456), A Green Sample
# (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power Overwhelming (92489), The Crone
# of the Kraul (1101), Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends
# (7482), Lethtendris's Web (7488), The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla
# (2770), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps (971),
# Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The Lost
# Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
# (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential
# Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929),
# Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate
